===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|id=electronic|:abbr|electronic mail<ety:af<electronic><mail<id:bag>>>|tree=1}}

The {{glossary|noun}} is an {{glossary|abbreviation}} of {{m|en|electronic mail}}. {{etydate|1979}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.{{sup|2}}''|noformat=yes|id=60701|date=September 2011|nodot=yes}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}.</ref> The {{glossary|verb}} is derived from the noun, by analogy with {{m|en|mail|t=to send through the mail}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=v|id=240904|date=September 2011|nodot=yes}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=v}}</ref>

